Package: ffmpeg-rockchip
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: co-installable FFmpeg 6.1 Rockchip runtime
 This package provides nyanmisaka's FFmpeg 6.1 Rockchip fork with RKMPP and
 RKRGA enabled. It installs under /opt/ffmpeg-rockchip and exposes
 ffmpeg-rockchip, ffprobe-rockchip, and ffplay-rockchip commands, so it can be
 installed alongside Ubuntu's normal ffmpeg and libav* packages.
